tps://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/al-na-9d5791cf-3faf/d94e4843-29bd-48f6-a524-9b00ff9a045b.png\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:1500,\&quot;width\&quot;:800,\&quot;sizeInBytes\&quot;:2992952,\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;GB_vertical_2.png\&quot;,\&quot;aspectRatio\&quot;:0.5333333333333333,\&quot;realCrop\&quot;:{\&quot;x\&quot;:0,\&quot;y\&quot;:38.89,\&quot;width\&quot;:800,\&quot;height\&quot;:1422.22,\&quot;aspectRatio\&quot;:0.56}},\&quot;wide\&quot;:{\&quot;assetId\&quot;:\&quot;amzn1.assetlibrary.asset1.4b9fe36c74c1495ac500fe6e0923b9e9\&quot;,\&quot;versionId\&quot;:\&quot;version_v1\&quot;,\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/al-na-9d5791cf-3faf/eac41bbd-3ac4-4145-b291-3320fdb2a13c.png\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:800,\&quot;width\&quot;:1500,\&quot;sizeInBytes\&quot;:1741447,\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;GB_Horizontal_1.png\&quot;,\&quot;aspectRatio\&quot;:1.875,\&quot;realCrop\&quot;:{\&quot;x\&quot;:0,\&quot;y\&quot;:7.33,\&quot;width\&quot;:1500,\&quot;height\&quot;:785.34,\&quot;aspectRatio\&quot;:1.91}}},\&quot;logoImgUrl\&quot;:\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/al-na-9d5791cf-3faf/c57dd3fd-77ec-466c-95b2-27c247754a1e.png\&quot;,\&quot;isPreview\&quot;:false,\&quot;priceInformation\&quot;:{\&quot;price\&quot;:229.99,\&quot;fullPrice\&quot;:null,\&quot;pricePerUnit\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;currencyCode\&quot;:\&quot;USD\&quot;},\&quot;isPrimeEligible\&quot;:true,\&quot;productDescription\&quot;:\&quot;GIBBON SlackBoard, Balance Board Kids &amp; Adults, Slackline Balance Trainer | 1 &amp; 2 Line Options, Slack Board, Core Workout Equipment, Home Gym Training, Standing Desk Exercise, Yoga, Agility, Pilates\&quot;,\&quot;ratings\&quot;:{\&quot;stars\&quot;:4.8,\&quot;amount\&quot;:39},\&quot;climatePledgeFriendlyBadge\&quot;:{\&quot;attributeCount\&quot;:0,\&quot;certCount\&quot;:0},\&quot;dealBadge\&quot;:{},\&quot;aapiBrandName\&quot;:\&quot;GIBBON\&quot;,\&quot;ctaText\&quot;:\&quot;shop-now\&quot;,\&quot;productGroupType\&quot;:\&quot;gl_sports\&quot;,\&quot;resolvedAceiData\&quot;:{\&quot;renderFeatureFlags\&quot;:{},\&quot;renderLogData\&quot;:{\&quot;eligibleSCE\&quot;:[],\&quot;metrics\&quot;:[]},\&quot;aceiExperimentsToRecord\&quot;:{}},\&quot;asin\&quot;:\&quot;B0FL5YTYGG\&quot;,\&quot;productQnADetails\&quot;:{\&quot;productQnA\&quot;:[{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How does it work as a snowboard trainer?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus simulates the lateral balance and weight-shifting movements used in snowboarding, helping build coordination and motor skills that transfer directly to the slopes. GIBBON describes it as a trainer that transitions &#39;seamlessly from practice to the real thing.&#39; The low-profile design keeps users close to the ground, which reduces fall risk while you develop technique. It supports up to 400 lbs and works on multiple surfaces — hardwood, carpet, or outdoor patios — so you can train year-round wherever you have space.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;Does the cork bottom grip all floor types?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The cork bottom is designed to grip hardwood floors, carpets, grass, and outdoor patios — covering both indoor and outdoor surfaces. This material choice also supports long-term durability, even with daily use on varied terrain.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;Does it work well under a standing desk?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus is specifically designed to work as a balance board for standing desks, letting you integrate movement into your workday. Its low-profile design keeps you close to the ground, and the cork bottom provides a solid grip on hardwood floors and carpets — common surfaces in home and office setups. It supports up to 400 lbs and weighs just 7.5 lbs, making it easy to move in and out of your workspace.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;What wood gives it a 400 lb rating?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus is crafted from sustainably USA-sourced American maple wood, a dense hardwood known for its structural integrity, which supports the board&#39;s 400 lb weight capacity. The cork bottom adds grip stability on hardwood floors, carpets, grass, and outdoor patios, complementing the maple&#39;s durability for daily use.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How does the low-profile design help?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The low-profile SlackBoard Plus design keeps users close to the ground, which helps reduce the risk of falls during training. This makes it especially approachable for beginners building confidence, while still offering enough challenge for experienced users refining their technique. The design also supports seamless transitions between indoor and outdoor use.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How durable is the maple wood build?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus is crafted from sustainably USA-sourced American maple wood, chosen for long-term durability even with daily use. It supports up to 400 lbs without compromising safety, and the thoughtful construction is described as built for performance. A cork bottom adds grip stability on hardwood floors, carpets, grass, and outdoor patios — extending the board&#39;s usability across environments.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;How does it help beginners build confidence?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus uses an innovative 2-line board setup that provides extra stability compared to a single-line configuration, making it easier for first-timers to find their footing. Its low-profile design keeps users close to the ground, which helps reduce the risk of falls during early practice. GIBBON specifically recommends this board as the starting point for anyone new to balance board training.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;Does it work for all skill levels?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The SlackBoard Plus is designed for all skill levels, from beginners to experienced users. Its innovative 2-line board setup provides extra stability, helping beginners build confidence while still offering enough challenge for experienced users to refine their techniques. The low-profile design also keeps users close to the ground, reducing the risk of falls as you progress.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;}]},\&quot;productTitleType\&quot;:\&quot;DEFAULT\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;DISPLAY\&quot;,\&quot;productImg\&quot;:{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g0pFNGUnL.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;altText\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;colorTreatment\&quot;:\&quot;default\&quot;},\&quot;videos\&quot;:[],\&quot;components\&quot;:[\&quot;Image\&quot;,\&quot;BuyBox\&quot;,\&quot;Headline\&quot;,\&quot;Logo\&quot;],\&quot;border\&quot;:true,\&quot;storeContextName\&quot;:\&quot;Balance Boards (Sports &amp; Outdoors)\&quot;,\&quot;clickThroughInfo\&quot;:{\&quot;impressionUrls\&quot;:[],\&quot;isOffsite\&quot;:false,\&quot;adLink\&quot;:\&quot;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FL5YTYGG?aref=YKAKf7hLTK&amp;aaxitk=7edad8e99038a37813bab6609f86c45b&amp;language=en_US&amp;pd_rd_plhdr=t&amp;ref=dacx_dp_583848505438005236_581794190641022197\&quot;,\&quot;reviewLink\&quot;:\&quot;https://www.amazon.com/product-reviews/B0FL5YTYGG?aref=YKAKf7hLTK&amp;aaxitk=7edad8e99038a37813bab6609f86c45b&amp;language=en_US\&quot;,\&quot;buttonLink\&quot;:\&quot;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FL5YTYGG?aref=YKAKf7hLTK&amp;aaxitk=7edad8e99038a37813bab6609f86c45b&amp;language=en_US&amp;pd_rd_plhdr=t&amp;ref=dacx_dp_583848505438005236_581794190641022197\&quot;,\&quot;clickUrls\&quot;:[\&quot;https://aax-events-cell01-cf.us-east.ono.axp.amazon-adsy